<template><main class="login-page"><section class="login-panel"><div class="login-brand"><span class="brand-mark">F</span><span>FITNESS<br><strong>COPILOT</strong></span></div><span class="eyebrow lime">YOUR TRAINING COMPANION</span><h1>{{ isRegistering ? "创建你的账户" : "欢迎回来" }}</h1><p>从身体数据开始，生成适合你的训练与饮食计划。</p><form @submit.prevent="submit"><label>账号<input v-model.trim="form.account" autocomplete="username" placeholder="字母、数字、下划线或连字符"></label><label>密码<input v-model="form.password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="至少 8 个字符"></label><p v-if="error" class="form-error">{{ error }}</p><button class="login-submit" :disabled="loading" type="submit">{{ loading ? "正在提交…" : (isRegistering ? "注册并开始" : "登录") }}</button></form><button class="switch-auth" type="button" @click="isRegistering = !isRegistering; error = ''">{{ isRegistering ? "已有账户？去登录" : "还没有账户？立即注册" }}</button></section><aside class="login-visual"><div><span class="eyebrow lime">DAY BY DAY</span><h2>训练不是冲刺，<br>而是长期的陪伴。</h2><div class="visual-bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div></aside></main></template>
<script>import { authApi, profileApi } from "../api/fitness"; import { session, setSession } from "../api/session"; export default { data: function () { return { isRegistering: false, loading: false, error: "", form: { account: "", password: "" } }; }, methods: { submit: async function () { this.error = ""; this.loading = true; try { var response = this.isRegistering ? await authApi.register(this.form) : await authApi.login(this.form); setSession(response); var profile = await profileApi.get(); session.bio = profile.bio || ""; session.avatarDataUrl = profile.avatarDataUrl || ""; this.$router.push("/"); } catch (error) { this.error = error.message; } finally { this.loading = false; } } } };</script>
